title: "AFRICA-ZT-EDU: A Policy-Centric Zero-Trust and Privacy-Preserving Architecture for Cross-Border Digital Education in Africa"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: Bourkibate
    given-names: Abdessamad
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-6186-8071"
date-released: 2026-08-18
version: 1.0.0
keywords:
  - zero trust
  - digital education
  - Africa
  - privacy engineering
  - verifiable credentials
  - differential privacy
  - federated analytics
  - cross-border data flows
abstract: >-
  A policy-centric zero-trust and privacy-preserving reference architecture
  for cross-border digital education, evaluated through a transparent
  analytical rubric, a 3,000,000-request synthetic policy experiment,
  privacy-utility and registry-staleness sensitivity analyses, and a
  reproducible single-host microbenchmark.
